<http://example.org/dataset/processing-of-personal-data> a dcat:Dataset ;
    lomo:establishedIn <https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/545/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_545/FINAL/eng/art_19> ;
    dcterms:conformsTo <http://example.org/standard/to-fulfil-obligations-under-this-regulation-and-other-legal-acts-it-is-necessary-to-collect-and-process-different-categories-of-personal-data> ;
    dcterms:title "Processing of personal data"@en .

<http://example.org/dataset/the-single-portal-shall-contain-and-publish-data-onthe-activities-financed-by-the-budget-including-on-the-progress-of-the-financial-implementation-and-performance-broken-down-by-programme-and-by-chapter-of-a-plan-by-a-member-state-where-relevantinformation-on-aggregated-performance-broken-down-by-programme-and-intervention-field-using-the-relevant-performance-indicatorsinformation-on-contribution-towards-policies-such-as-green-social-and-gender-equalityoperations-financed-by-the-budgetfor-activities-implemented-directly-by-the-commission-the-level-of-subscription-in-particular-the-number-of-proposals-and-per-call-for-proposals-their-average-score-the-share-of-proposals-above-and-below-quality-thresholdsinformation-referred-to-in-article-413-point-h-of-regulation-eu-euratom-20242509> a dcat:Dataset ;
    lomo:establishedIn <https://data.europa.eu/eli/dl/proc/2025/545/cod/doc/com/COM_2025_545/FINAL/eng/art_12> ;
    dcterms:conformsTo <http://example.org/standard/this-data-should-be-published-by-the-commission-through-a-dedicated-publicly-available-website-the-single-gateway-with-several-content-sections> ;
    dcterms:title "The single portal shall contain and publish data on:the activities financed by the budget, including on the progress of the financial implementation and performance, broken down by programme and by chapter of a plan by a Member State where relevant;information on aggregated performance broken down by programme and intervention field, using the relevant performance indicators;information on contribution towards policies such as green, social and gender equality;operations financed by the budget;for activities implemented directly by the Commission, the level of subscription, in particular the number of proposals and per call for proposals, their average score, the share of proposals above and below quality thresholds;information referred to in Article 41(3), point (h) of Regulation (EU, Euratom) 2024/2509."@en .

<http://example.org/process/data-collection> skos:prefLabel "Data collection"@en .

<http://example.org/process/data-collection-and-publication> skos:prefLabel "Data collection and publication"@en .

<http://example.org/process/data-processing> skos:prefLabel "Data processing"@en .

<http://example.org/standard/member-states-should-in-particular-have-systems-and-procedures-in-place-to-ensure-that-all-supporting-documents-related-to-a-measure-supported-by-the-fund-are-kept-at-the-appropriate-level-for-a-x-year-period-from-x-of-the-year-in-which-the-last-payment-by-the-commission-to-the-member-state-is-made> a dcterms:Standard ;
    dcterms:title "Member States should, in particular, have systems and procedures in place to ensure that all supporting documents related to a measure supported by the Fund are kept at the appropriate level for a X-year period from X of the year in which the last payment by the Commission to the Member State is made"@en .

<http://example.org/standard/the-commission-shall-inform-annually-the-european-parliament-and-the-council-on-the-level-of-implementation-of-the-programmes-based-on-such-performance-information> a dcterms:Standard ;
    dcterms:title "The Commission shall inform annually the European Parliament and the Council on the level of implementation of the programmes based on such performance information."@en .

<http://example.org/standard/this-data-should-be-published-by-the-commission-through-a-dedicated-publicly-available-website-the-single-gateway-with-several-content-sections> a dcterms:Standard ;
    dcterms:title "This data should be published by the Commission through a dedicated publicly available website (the ‘Single Gateway’), with several content sections."@en .

<http://example.org/standard/to-fulfil-obligations-under-this-regulation-and-other-legal-acts-it-is-necessary-to-collect-and-process-different-categories-of-personal-data> a dcterms:Standard ;
    dcterms:title "To fulfil obligations under this Regulation and other legal acts, it is necessary to collect and process different categories of personal data."@en .

